  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Place the naan bread on a baking sheet lined with parchment paper.",
    "Spread a layer of confit tomatoes over each piece of naan bread.",
    "Sprinkle shredded mozzarella cheese over the tomatoes.",
    "Drizzle olive oil over the cheese and sprinkle with garlic powder, salt, and pepper.",
    "Bake the flatbreads in the preheated oven for 12 minutes, or until the cheese is melted and bubbly.",
    "Remove the flatbreads from the oven and sprinkle with chopped fresh basil.",
    "Serve the Zesty American Tomato Flatbreads hot and enjoy."
